                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "44729391",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198807648889",
                            "num_reviews": 23,
                            "playtime_forever": 988,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 988,
                            "last_played": 1536452235
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a really cool game. I love the graphics this game has, it has a steampunk theme to it. The music is great. You'll notice the theme song throughout the game. Since this is a VR game, it really makes you feel immersive. Along your journey, you can explore this world and interact with the surroundings. You have this side kick, Boka, who helps you on your journey. If you like Legend of Zelda, then you might like this game. It has various puzzles you need to solve along the journey. Some puzzles were difficult, some were easy. If you keep trying, I'm sure you'll finish it. I finished this game and liked my journey and I hope there is a Chiaro 2 coming out. I can't wait for it. I actually want to buy a cute Boka stuffed animal, if available, because I loved this game.",
